ft shoulder, right shoulder.","action_fr":"Faire le grand signe de croix avec la main droite : front, poitrine, épaule gauche, épaule droite.","why_en":"This traditional lay gesture accompanies specific invocations or conclusions; it is not a cue to imitate every Sign of the Cross made by the priest.","why_fr":"Ce geste traditionnel accompagne certaines invocations ou conclusions ; il ne demande pas d’imiter chaque signe de croix du prêtre.","status_en":"Established traditional practice","status_fr":"Usage traditionnel établi","sources":["OCONNELL","GUERANGER"]},"raw":{"kind":"cross","label":"Sign of the cross","authority":"ESTABLISHED_LAY_CUSTOM","sourceRefs":["GUERANGER","COCHEM","MULLER"]}},{"id":"gospel-announcement:1:gospel_crosses_3","step":"gospel-announcement","actor":"FAITHFUL","underlying_actor":null,"action":"GOSPEL_CROSSES_3","anchor_lat":"Sequéntia ✠ sancti Evangélii","anchor_en":"Continuation ✠ of the Holy Gospel","anchor_fr":"Sequéntia ✠ sancti Evangélii","anchor_placement":"before","authority":"ESTABLISHED_LAY_CUSTOM","lay_status":"ESTABLISHED_LAY_CUSTOM","sourceRefs":["OCONNELL"],"conditions":{},"suppressions":[],"mass_forms":["LOW","SUNG","SOLEMN"],"season":"ANY","requiem":"CONTEXTUAL","special_day":"ANY","posture_before":null,"posture_after":null,"icon_semantic":"GOSPEL_CROSSES_3","printed_cross_icon_dedupe":false,"count":null,"prominence":"CORE","compatibility_only":false,"guide":{"action_en":"With the right thumb, trace a small cross on the forehead, then the lips, then the breast.","action_fr":"Avec le pouce droit, tracer une petite croix sur le front, puis les lèvres, puis la poitrine.","why_en":"The three Gospel crosses are a distinct traditional gesture associated with receiving the Gospel in mind, speech and heart.","why_fr":"Les trois petites croix de l’Évangile sont un geste traditionnel distinct, associé à l’accueil de l’Évangile dans l’intelligence, la parole et le cœur.","status_en":"Established traditional practice","status_fr":"Usage traditionnel établi","sources":["OCONNELL"]},"raw":{"kind":"cross","label":"Forehead · lips · breast","authority":"PERIOD_1962_GUIDE","sourceRefs":["OCONNELL_1962","GUERANGER","COCHEM","MULLER"],"gestureForm":"SIGN_CROSS_GOSPEL"}},{"id":"credo:1:head_bow","step":"credo","actor":"FAITHFUL","underlying_actor":null,"action":"HEAD_BOW","anchor_lat":"Credo in unum Deum","anchor_en":"I believe in one God","anchor_fr":"JE CROIS en un seul Dieu","anchor_placement":"before","authority":"ESTABLISHED_LAY_CUSTOM","lay_status":"ESTABLISHED_LAY_CUSTOM","sourceRefs":["OCONNELL"],"conditions":{},"suppressions":[],"mass_forms":["LOW","SUNG","SOLEMN"],"season":"ANY","requiem":"CONTEXTUAL","special_day":"ANY","posture_before":null,"posture_after":null,"icon_semantic":"HEAD_BOW","printed_cross_icon_dedupe":false,"count":null,"prominence":"DETAIL","compatibility_only":false,"guide":{"action_en":"Briefly incline the head at the indicated words.","action_fr":"Incliner brièvement la tête aux paroles indiquées.","why_en":"A restrained traditional act of reverence toward the sacred name or phrase.","why_fr":"Acte traditionnel et mesuré de révérence envers le nom ou la formule sacrée.","status_en":"Established traditional practice","status_fr":"Usage traditionnel établi","sources":["OCONNELL"]},"raw":{"kind":"bow","label":"Bow head","authority":"traditional_faithful_custom","sourceRefs":["OCONNELL_1962"]}},{"id":"credo:2:genuflect","step":"credo","actor":"FAITHFUL","underlying_actor":null,"action":"GENUFLECT","anchor_lat":"Et incarnátus est","anchor_en":"And was incarnate","anchor_fr":"Et il a pris chair de la Vierge Marie","anchor_placement":"before","authority":"ESTABLISHED_LAY_CUSTOM","lay_status":"ESTABLISHED_LAY_CUSTOM","sourceRefs":["OCONNELL"],"conditions":{},"suppressions":[],"mass_forms":["LOW","SUNG","SOLEMN"],"season":"ANY","requiem":"CONTEXTUAL","special_day":"ANY","posture_before":null,"posture_after":null,"icon_semantic":"GENUFLECT","printed_cross_icon_dedupe":false,"count":nul