mea máxima culpa","anchor_en":"through my fault, through my fault, through my most grievous fault","anchor_fr":null,"anchor_placement":"before","authority":"OLDER_CUSTOM_NON_NORMATIVE_1962","lay_status":"OLDER_CUSTOM_NON_NORMATIVE_1962","sourceRefs":["MR1962_RG","OCONNELL"],"conditions":{"second_confiteor_setting":true},"suppressions":[],"mass_forms":["LOW","SUNG","SOLEMN"],"season":"ANY","requiem":"CONTEXTUAL","special_day":"ANY","posture_before":null,"posture_after":null,"icon_semantic":"BREAST_STRIKE_3","printed_cross_icon_dedupe":false,"count":3,"prominence":"DETAIL","compatibility_only":true,"guide":{"action_en":"Strike the breast three times with the repeated text.","action_fr":"Frapper la poitrine trois fois avec le texte répété.","why_en":"The repeated breast-striking accompanies the threefold penitential invocation or profession of unworthiness.","why_fr":"Les trois coups accompagnent la triple invocation pénitentielle ou profession d’indignité.","status_en":"Older custom — non-normative in the 1962 books","status_fr":"Usage ancien — non normatif dans les livres de 1962","sources":["MR1962_RG","OCONNELL"]},"raw":{"kind":"action","label":"Strike the breast ×3 at mea culpa","authority":"PRE_1962_ONLY","sourceRefs":["RGM_1960","OCONNELL_1962"]}},{"id":"second-confiteor:2:sign_of_cross","step":"second-confiteor","actor":"FAITHFUL","underlying_actor":null,"action":"SIGN_OF_CROSS","anchor_lat":"Indulgéntiam","anchor_en":"May the Almighty and merciful God","anchor_fr":null,"anchor_placement":"before","authority":"OLDER_CUSTOM_NON_NORMATIVE_1962","lay_status":"OLDER_CUSTOM_NON_NORMATIVE_1962","sourceRefs":["MR1962_RG","OCONNELL"],"conditions":{"second_confiteor_setting":true},"suppressions":[],"mass_forms":["LOW","SUNG","SOLEMN"],"season":"ANY","requiem":"CONTEXTUAL","special_day":"ANY","posture_before":null,"posture_after":null,"icon_semantic":"SIGN_OF_CROSS","printed_cross_icon_dedupe":true,"count":null,"prominence":"DETAIL","compatibility_only":true,"guide":{"action_en":"Make the full Sign of the Cross with the right hand: forehead, breast, left shoulder, right shoulder.","action_fr":"Faire le grand signe de croix avec la main droite : front, poitrine, épaule gauche, épaule droite.","why_en":"This traditional lay gesture accompanies specific invocations or conclusions; it is not a cue to imitate every Sign of the Cross made by the priest.","why_fr":"Ce geste traditionnel accompagne certaines invocations ou conclusions ; il ne demande pas d’imiter chaque signe de croix du prêtre.","status_en":"Older custom — non-normative in the 1962 books","status_fr":"Usage ancien — non normatif dans les livres de 1962","sources":["MR1962_RG","OCONNELL"]},"raw":{"kind":"cross","label":"Make the sign of the cross","authority":"PRE_1962_ONLY","sourceRefs":["RGM_1960","OCONNELL_1962"]}},{"id":"preface:1:head_bow","step":"preface","actor":"FAITHFUL","underlying_actor":null,"action":"HEAD_BOW","anchor_lat":"Grátias agámus Dómino Deo nostro","anchor_en":"Let us give thanks to the Lord our God","anchor_fr":"Rendons grâces au Seigneur notre Dieu","anchor_placement":"before","authority":"ESTABLISHED_LAY_CUSTOM","lay_status":"ESTABLISHED_LAY_CUSTOM","sourceRefs":["OCONNELL"],"conditions":{},"suppressions":[],"mass_forms":["LOW","SUNG","SOLEMN"],"season":"ANY","requiem":"CONTEXTUAL","special_day":"ANY","posture_before":null,"posture_after":null,"icon_semantic":"HEAD_BOW","printed_cross_icon_dedupe":false,"count":null,"prominence":"DETAIL","compatibility_only":false,"guide":{"action_en":"Briefly incline the head at the indicated words.","action_fr":"Incliner brièvement la tête aux paroles indiquées.","why_en":"A restrained traditional act of reverence toward the sacred name or phrase.","why_fr":"Acte traditionnel et mesuré de révérence envers le nom ou la formule sacrée.","status_en":"Established traditional practice","status_fr":"Usage traditionnel établi","sources":["OCONNELL"]},"raw":{"kind":"bow","label":"Bow head","authority":"traditional_faithf